  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aratarach Farmers Cassava Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Cassava, Beneficiaries: 164 farmers, 64 female and 100 male, Summary: The project funds will be used to hire office staff; train staff in good governance practices; purchase accounting software and train staff in financial management; develop policies for finances, human resources, and procurement; hire consultants to develop business and marketing plans; purchase office equipment; provide working capital for the purchase of farmer&apos;s produce, and improve the quantity and quality of cassava produced.</narrative>
  </description>
